= RDF test data (root)

This folder holds the synthetic top-level RDF fixtures for the graphinout
reader-rdf module, plus one expected ConnectedJson conversion output. The
collected, real-world RDF samples that used to live in the per-format sub-folders
were migrated to the graph-test-data repo (text/turtle/, text/n-triples/,
text/rdf-nquads/, text/trig/, text/notation3/, json/json-ld/, json/rdf-json/,
xml/rdf-xml/, xml/trix/). Only synthetic fixtures remain here: a couple of
hand-authored Turtle/N-Triples files in nt/ and ttl/.

ddot.it/this ..content.. top-level RDF fixtures (Turtle) and one expected RDF-to-ConnectedJson conversion output

# example-simple.ttl: small synthetic Turtle graph of three Persons
example-simple.ttl ..kind.. synthetic
example-simple.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
example-simple.ttl ..content.. minimal example FOAF-like social graph (Alice/Bob/Charlie) using an http://example.org/ namespace
example-simple.ttl ..tests.. prefixed names, rdf:type via 'a', integer datatype literals, ex:knows object references
example-simple.ttl ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
example-simple.ttl ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

# test.ttl: the input for the RDF -> ConnectedJson conversion test
test.ttl ..kind.. synthetic
test.ttl ..format.. format:turtle
test.ttl ..content.. two ex:knows triples (Alice knows Bob, Bob knows Charlie) over an https://example.com/ namespace
test.ttl ..tests.. simple directed-edge graph used as conversion input
test.ttl ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
test.ttl ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

# test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json: expected output of converting test.ttl to ConnectedJson
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..kind.. synthetic
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..format.. format:connected-json
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..content.. expected ConnectedJson result of converting test.ttl (3 nodes Alice/Bob/Charlie, 2 ex:knows edges with in/out endpoints)
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..tests.. RDF triple-to-ConnectedJson edge/endpoint mapping (golden file for rdf2cj)
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
test--EXPECTED-rdf2cj.cj.json ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)
